#: ../../navigation.rst:2
msgid "Navigation"
msgstr "导航"

#: ../../navigation.rst:4
msgid ""
"Moving around a genome is the part you do most, so Orbit tries to make every"
" route to a locus one action long."
msgstr "在基因组上移动是你做得最多的操作，所以 Orbit 尽量让到达任意位点都只需一步。"

#: ../../navigation.rst:8
msgid "Search syntax"
msgstr "搜索语法"

#: ../../navigation.rst:10
msgid ""
"The search box accepts several forms and figures out which one you meant:"
msgstr "搜索框接受多种写法，并自行判断你想表达哪一种："

#: ../../navigation.rst:16
msgid "Input"
msgstr "输入"

#: ../../navigation.rst:17
msgid "Result"
msgstr "结果"

#: ../../navigation.rst:18
msgid "``TP53``"
msgstr "``TP53``"

#: ../../navigation.rst:19
msgid "Jumps to the gene, case-insensitive"
msgstr "跳到该基因，不区分大小写"

#: ../../navigation.rst:20
msgid "``chr17:7,668,402-7,687,550``"
msgstr "``chr17:7,668,402-7,687,550``"

#: ../../navigation.rst:21
msgid "That interval on chr17"
msgstr "chr17 上的这个区间"

#: ../../navigation.rst:22
msgid "``chr17:7668402-7687550``"
msgstr "``chr17:7668402-7687550``"

#: ../../navigation.rst:23
msgid "Same, without thousands separators"
msgstr "同上，不带千分位分隔符"

#: ../../navigation.rst:24
msgid "``7,668,402-7,687,550``"
msgstr "``7,668,402-7,687,550``"

#: ../../navigation.rst:25
msgid "Uses the current chromosome"
msgstr "使用当前染色体"

#: ../../navigation.rst:26
msgid "``chr17:7,668,402``"
msgstr "``chr17:7,668,402``"

#: ../../navigation.rst:27
msgid "A single base, shown with a 50 bp flank"
msgstr "单个碱基，两侧各留 50 bp"

#: ../../navigation.rst:28
msgid "``chr17``"
msgstr "``chr17``"

#: ../../navigation.rst:29
msgid "The whole chromosome"
msgstr "整条染色体"

#: ../../navigation.rst:31
msgid ""
"If a gene symbol matches several genes, the first hit is used and a list of "
"alternatives is offered. Press :kbd:`Enter` again to cycle through them."
msgstr "如果一个基因名匹配到多个基因，取第一个命中并给出候选列表。再按一次 :kbd:`Enter` 可在候选之间循环。"

#: ../../navigation.rst:35
msgid "Zooming and panning"
msgstr "缩放与平移"

#: ../../navigation.rst:37
msgid "Mouse wheel zooms around the cursor"
msgstr "滚轮以光标为中心缩放"

#: ../../navigation.rst:38
msgid "Dragging on the ruler pans; dragging on a gene selects a range"
msgstr "在标尺上拖动平移；在基因上拖动则选中一个区间"

#: ../../navigation.rst:39
msgid ":kbd:`+` / :kbd:`-` zoom around the centre"
msgstr ":kbd:`+` / :kbd:`-` 以中心缩放"

#: ../../navigation.rst:40
msgid ""
"The zoom level is shown as base pairs per pixel, which is the honest measure"
" of how much detail you are actually seeing"
msgstr "缩放级别显示为每像素多少碱基，这是衡量你实际看清多少细节的诚实指标"

#: ../../navigation.rst:43
msgid ""
"There is a hard limit at one base per pixel. Beyond that the sequence track "
"takes over — it draws coloured bases instead of pretending to have more "
"resolution."
msgstr "硬上限是每像素 1 个碱基。再往下就交给序列轨道——它画出带颜色的碱基，而不是假装还有更高分辨率。"

#: ../../navigation.rst:48
msgid "Split view"
msgstr "分屏视图"

#: ../../navigation.rst:50
msgid ""
"Split view shows up to four independent loci at once, each with its own "
"chromosome, coordinates and selection. It is the fastest way to compare the "
"same gene across samples, or to check that an event really is where you "
"think it is."
msgstr "分屏可同时显示最多四个独立位点，各自有染色体、坐标和选区。比较不同样本间的同一基因，或确认某个事件是否真在你以为的位置，这是最快的办法。"

#: ../../navigation.rst:55
msgid "Choose *2*, *3* or *4* panes from the toolbar"
msgstr "在工具栏选择 *2*、*3* 或 *4* 个面板"

#: ../../navigation.rst:56
msgid ""
"Each pane keeps its own search state; :kbd:`Ctrl` + :kbd:`1` … :kbd:`4` "
"focuses a pane"
msgstr "每个面板保留各自的搜索状态；:kbd:`Ctrl` + :kbd:`1` … :kbd:`4` 可切换到对应面板"

#: ../../navigation.rst:58
msgid "Tracks are shared — load a bigWig once and it appears in every pane"
msgstr "轨道是共享的——载入一次 bigWig，所有面板都会出现"

#: ../../navigation.rst:59
msgid "The whole-genome overview is not split; it follows the focused pane"
msgstr "全基因组总览不分屏，跟随当前聚焦的面板"

#: ../../navigation.rst:62
msgid "Deep links"
msgstr "深链接"

#: ../../navigation.rst:64
msgid "Every view has a URL you can paste into a notebook or a chat:"
msgstr "每个视图都有 URL，可以直接贴进笔记或聊天："

#: ../../navigation.rst:70
msgid "Parameters:"
msgstr "参数："

#: ../../navigation.rst:76
msgid "Key"
msgstr "参数"

#: ../../navigation.rst:77
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../../navigation.rst:78
msgid "``db``"
msgstr "``db``"

#: ../../navigation.rst:79
msgid "Assembly id, for example ``hg38`` or ``mm39``"
msgstr "装配 id，例如 ``hg38`` 或 ``mm39``"

#: ../../navigation.rst:80
msgid "``locus``"
msgstr "``locus``"

#: ../../navigation.rst:81
msgid "A locus in any of the search-box forms"
msgstr "位点，支持搜索框的所有写法"

#: ../../navigation.rst:82
msgid "``tracks``"
msgstr "``tracks``"

#: ../../navigation.rst:83
msgid "Comma-separated track names to enable"
msgstr "要启用的轨道名，逗号分隔"

#: ../../navigation.rst:85
msgid ""
"When Orbit runs as a desktop window the address bar is not visible, but the "
"link is still accepted: launch with ``--browser`` and the page reads the "
"query string, or paste the locus part into the search box."
msgstr "以桌面窗口运行时看不到地址栏，但链接同样有效：加 ``--browser`` 启动，页面会读取查询串；或者把位点部分粘进搜索框。"

#: ../../navigation.rst:90
msgid "Transcript expansion"
msgstr "转录本展开"

#: ../../navigation.rst:92
msgid ""
"Click any gene to expand it into its transcripts. Expanded genes show exons,"
" introns, CDS thickness, and the coding direction; the row grows from 32 to "
"54 pixels and the label is drawn on top of the feature when there is no room"
" beside it."
msgstr ""
"点任意基因即可展开它的转录本。展开后显示外显子、内含子、CDS 厚度和编码方向；行高从 32 px 变成 54 px，名字在特征旁边放不下时压在特征上。"

#: ../../navigation.rst:97
msgid "Click again to collapse"
msgstr "再点一次收起"

#: ../../navigation.rst:98
msgid ":kbd:`Shift` + click expands every gene in the window"
msgstr ":kbd:`Shift` + 点击可展开窗口内所有基因"

#: ../../navigation.rst:99
msgid "The expanded set is remembered across sessions"
msgstr "展开状态会跨会话记住"

#: ../../navigation.rst:102
msgid "The whole-genome overview"
msgstr "全基因组总览"

#: ../../navigation.rst:104
msgid ""
"The overview at the bottom lists every primary chromosome as a horizontal "
"bar whose length is proportional to the chromosome size, with the current "
"window marked in colour. It starts collapsed as a single row for the current"
" chromosome; press the chevron to expand all 25 rows. Clicking a bar "
"navigates to that chromosome."
msgstr ""
"底部的总览把每条主染色体画成一条横条，长度与染色体大小成正比，当前窗口用颜色标出。它默认折叠成当前染色体的单行；按箭头展开全部 25 "
"行。点某条即跳到该染色体。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "When Orbit runs as a desktop window the address bar is not visible, but the "
#~ "link is still accepted — *File → Open URL* takes the same string."
#~ msgstr ""
